# Expanded Global Search (Sets + Cards)

This plan expands the global search functionality to return individual cards alongside sets, ensuring users can find specific products directly from the header search bar.

## Proposed Changes

### [Models]

#### [MODIFY] [Store_model.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/models/Store_model.php)
- Add `search_active_pokemon_cards($query)` to find Pokémon cards in stock.

#### [MODIFY] [Mtg_model.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/models/Mtg_model.php)
- Add `search_active_mtg_cards($query)` to find Magic cards in stock.

#### [MODIFY] [Lorcana_model.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/models/Lorcana_model.php)
- Add `search_active_lorcana_cards($query)` to find Lorcana cards in stock.

#### [MODIFY] [OnePiece_model.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/models/OnePiece_model.php)
- Add `search_active_onepiece_cards($query)` to find One Piece cards in stock.

---

### [Controller]

#### [MODIFY] [Store.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/Store.php)
- Update [pokemon_index()](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/Store.php#28-41), [magic_index()](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/Store.php#62-76), [lorcana_index()](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/Store.php#99-113), and [onepiece_index()](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/Store.php#136-151) to:
    - Call the new model search methods if a query is present.
    - Pass the `matched_cards` result to the views.

---

### [Views]

#### [MODIFY] [Store Index Views](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/)
- Update [index.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/index.php) (Pokémon), [magic_index.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/magic_index.php), [lorcana_index.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/lorcana_index.php), and [onepiece_index.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/onepiece_index.php) to:
    - **Display a "Cards Found" section FIRST** (above sets) if card matches are returned.
    - Display the "Sets Found" section second.
    - Use a responsive grid (similar to the set view) to display card results.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- N/A

### Manual Verification
1. Search for a specific card name (e.g., "Pikachu", "Charizard") in the Pokémon category.
2. Verify both the set (if applicable) and individual cards appear in the results.
3. Repeat for Magic, Lorcana, and One Piece categories.
4. Verify "Clear Search" functionality works for both sets and cards.
